        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Thug Mentality 1999, Uni5 the Prequel: The Untold Story\n- People: Krayzie Bone, Gangsta Boo\n- Groups: Bone Thugs-n-Harmony, The Marley Brothers\n- Places: Memphis, Tennessee\n\nFacts:\n- Lola Mitchell was born on August 7, 1979, and is better known by the stage names Gangsta Boo and Lady Boo.\n- Gangsta Boo is an American rapper from Memphis, Tennessee.\n- Thug Mentality 1999 is the debut solo album by American rapper Krayzie Bone.\n- Thug Mentality 1999 is a double-disc album with guest appearances including Bone Thugs-n-Harmony, Mariah Carey, The Marley Brothers, Big Pun, Fat Joe, Cuban Link, Gangsta Boo, E-40, 8Ball & MJG, Kurupt, Treach, and Snoop Dogg.\n- Uni5 the Prequel: The Untold Story is an album by Bone Thugs-N-Harmony.\n- Uni5 the Prequel: The Untold Story features cuts and songs from other releases including Strength & Loyalty and Krayzie Bone's Thug Mentality 1999.",
